    <guid isPermaLink="false">673625faf373fe5d4d5dd5d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Nov 2024 22:16:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次在中亚这2个斯坦国待了半个月，想趁着回来记忆还鲜活赶快记录下旅行的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也没怎么剪辑，就是回来的录制 + 少数旅行中的声音日记，有兴趣的朋友凑活听吧哈哈哈。</span><br><span></span><br><span>本期 Vlog 也上线了，欢迎点击链接观看：</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QwefzRE9U/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QwefzRE9U/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee"><strong><span>中亚行纪 Vlog</span></strong></a><strong></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>粗糙的时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 首都塔什干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 希瓦 —— 花剌子模旧都</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 进入土库曼斯坦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">58:25</a> 布哈拉 —— 手工艺中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4340">1:12:20</a> 撒马尔罕的金桃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5420">1:30:20</a> 一路吃了啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5556">1:32:36</a> 旅途日记，记录下和当地人的互动与当下感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6969">1:56:09</a> 旅行结束</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一些旅途照片：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1u1ImB_QtR4eFpDlpxypMeH3XJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqey4p299PCKODUfa7qkfJr4zhup.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWcxqN0AY2_6mZW09wsbHIF72D0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FllhCONsEq78B9lIVkiUqZFQgiyl.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomandnNNwbKGygP4v8lawOP03i_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsUrkY8wkh0wOVVZp9eS1hY4C1JF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft3IXeyUdxCrwxjgJryGMzAAFe4a.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtiEQ6F7nVFczzgsCpeGzevDp30s.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3Y40EATykllMMGR4-S5qfKdoGg.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnHODFbUX4SDu_-HuDvX7hfrzezV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7MbIrgl-U_nUIPNd0SBl7pZF8o.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrrKx4GEsrUIiVt9B7WwdBwqPa_n.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoKysQzmpC6FjpSXkpkdGhD5GmWE.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>延展阅读：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《中亚行纪》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《失落的卫星》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《月亮照在阿姆河上》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《撒马尔罕的金桃》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
