    <guid isPermaLink="false">644e640f7d934b8505518696</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Apr 2023 12:50:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本集主要是扯闲篇，间歇带一点五一在家躺平对于之前外出旅行的回顾，比如冰岛回想（不是旅行攻略），以后旅行的展望，以及昨天连夜刷完最近热剧Beef/《怒呛人生》，极力推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的苏联 vs AI 废弃混凝土纪念碑</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtaOYoaZrpaRoqpoaMJRbH217hWD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lipiQ31_RzpRqwUhMx316F7CHv-Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>AI混入</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSw5U4GzOsTernLTfawr9ALCDZV.webp"></figure><span></span><h1><strong><span>圣地亚哥“朝圣之路”徒步线路</span></strong></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoKyIqh_T_7v4eOKYqMWBPmNEP7i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>冰岛照片回放</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lh4Aam3LavpqyYkgkWd6CJcDzzw0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>冰川徒步</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl6ZbsH630pSnzIEdrRN1pr3DjcH.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>魔法启封</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIlxakqicfICO0a1gjAA0K8jCbs.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>不像地球上看的的月亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>顺便我最近终于完成了时（拖）隔（延）3年的动森岛建，有兴趣的朋友可以点击以下视频：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJrbQZJmMHKvkhM8femdSYkmopk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ks4y1d746/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ks4y1d746/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee"><span>定格樱花季！拖延3年动森小岛</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>或者用</span><strong><span>【梦境码：DA-3105-1171-0407】</span></strong><span>直接去看哈~</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家五一愉快，好好休息、充电！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FillhRefaZuuR4xxXKuwL7tVgt5J.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>AI生成的Ricardo Bofill风格La Muralla Roja</span></p>]]></description>
