  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 闲聊，最近用AI做了啥以及怎么想的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6432e04a66e4c00c6aa32ab2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6432e04a66e4c00c6aa32ab2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Apr 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期就还是唠嗑，最近用AI(主要GPT, Bing, MidJourney)工作上，工作以外都拿它们做了啥，说AI要替代大家我方不方。AI到底能不能做真正的“创作”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>与AI生成了报告、资料、资料分类，时装x文学的短片，虚构的人物与摄影，写了代码，玩了文字冒险与猜词游戏等等，之后产生了一些想法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家聊一聊你最近的生活，和你使用各种AI工具的一些心得，感受到的长处与限制等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>聊到的AI生成作品：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ns4y1E7gZ/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ns4y1E7gZ/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee"><span>巴黎世家 x 哈利波特</span></a><span>；</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ch411g7R6/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ch411g7R6/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee"><span>Gucci x 爱丽丝梦游仙境（GPT, MidJourney, D-ID, Voicemaker, 我操作的剪映）：</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ch411g7R6/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ch411g7R6/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0&amp;vd_source=8545a43f846dcd51d0571a6a2f17c8ee">www.bilibili.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>与Bing的文字游戏截图：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtD8CDPkjg84u2UISMoj9YfiCU7x.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneZtSHwUmKyuWpj0sPkdr7uQPYL.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>MidJourney生成的一些摄影：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGU0F-1Iy8TRo96jabQts0gKdNX.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnc2LkYw6NKvhPsfodWcWiPQmvkv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjICQa6uRXHlbBfNrDdbQPp2lpzX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqYcZs25ZfPE5n3nOJpmPg8zzO8g.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图1 我自己的设计</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnsmKX7XPr-HWfk_rq7BgqR-H1Dl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图2 MJ对于我的图的描述</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fti_K6QTvUKkHx-wS-v5whnWQswL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图3 MJ基于自己描述生成的“我的餐厅”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmaKsazyIBZGHt3yTAN3z4K5B-Gh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图4 我的描述生成的“我的餐厅”</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎留言聊聊你对于AI的使用心得、疑问与看法呀，也欢迎对于选题提出你的想法~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>题图绘制：</span></strong><span>MidJourney</span></p>]]></description>
