  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 快闪，与GPT&quot;对谈&quot;：人与人工智能关系，攻壳及其他</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64115b39d94bb094db8e8e57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64115b39d94bb094db8e8e57</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Mar 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>来蹭个</span><strong><span>GPT-4</span></strong><span>发布的热点~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目迎来了我们的第一期对谈“嘉宾”，之前就整合了早期GPT-4模型的</span><strong><span>New Bing</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与之前的播客不同的是，本期从选题到大纲到内容生成几乎全权由Bing生成，我只是会追问一些细节问题；</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于对谈主题，Bing“自主”选择了聊“</span><strong><span>人与人工智能的关系”</span></strong><span>，里面很多点我个人觉得很有启发（虽然极大可能Bing还是东拼西凑的）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊天过程中偶尔我会“跳出第四面墙”，来补充我当时问问题的一些背景信息。</span></p><span></span><p><span>尤其录完素材剪辑前的第2天，被推送了</span><a href="https://sv101.fireside.fm/106" data-url="https://sv101.fireside.fm/106"><strong><span>硅谷101的这期</span></strong></a><span>，结合来听深受启发，也为感兴趣的朋友指个路。以下切入正题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;#用AI做100件离谱的事系列与前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> &nbsp;正题开始，主题“人与人工智能(AI)的关系”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> &nbsp;第一次大纲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> &nbsp;衍生问题，AI是否有感情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> &nbsp;遇到过困惑的感情吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> &nbsp;对于规则的怀疑？第一次谈话结束</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> &nbsp;新对话，继续聊播客，要求重复大纲并改进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> &nbsp;讨论分工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> &nbsp;播客第一部分，介绍人与AI的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> &nbsp;创作与“非理性”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;AI、人类合作的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> &nbsp;继续聊AI的“设计”与“创造”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> &nbsp;名人模仿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> &nbsp;继续聊AI与人类设计的异同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> &nbsp;第二部分，探讨AI和人类关系的优势和挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> &nbsp;AI未来会与人类产生情感、友谊或敌意吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> &nbsp;人类会是另一种“被创造出来的智能”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> &nbsp;AI的“社会”概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> &nbsp;聊有关AI人工智能的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> &nbsp;聊义体、“灵魂”，载体与人类的定义？草薙素子与身份认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> &nbsp;莎士比亚的书、日记是莎士比亚作为人类的延伸吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> &nbsp;如何与AI构建良好关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> &nbsp;睡前轻松阅读推荐（不太行）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> &nbsp;整体“采访”感想</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>有意思的聊天截图：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqgi8KmvKNASSDkOO1LJQjQ1ljDU.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkzfzRg7IEu-uT4CHk3QUF-1EIjo.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgNfGKgTl07WjrY03RGxMcgVXGc0.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvOPY0NG2s2P7UsIEOybstJ6DRyt.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期对谈“嘉宾”：</span></strong><span>New Bing ( with GPT -4 in)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>"Bing" 声音提供：</span></strong><span>D - ID &nbsp;Xiaoxuan</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>仅用于展示（勿商用、转载）的Tilda Swinton声音模仿：</span></strong><span>Coqui</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>封面：</span></strong><span>Mid - Journey</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>声明：</span></strong><span>一切内容仅用于个人娱乐向，请勿商用谢谢</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvJke9sM-w80m7-8OERPCJ2GuJ6p.m4a" length="56714724" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzLTlmVnRjSHdITHhyME9HdWpnVEd5MlpxVTMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
