  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 普通人AI使用漫谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640cb6b7acc110612a03fa52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640cb6b7acc110612a03fa52</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Mar 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期就是闲聊，趁着这阵AI热潮，主要是来聊聊我自己作为非码农试用各个AI产品（主要是文字、图像、视频等）的一些感想分享吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有任何朋友也有AI工具使用方面的心得，也欢迎在留言评论区分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>个人试用的AI工具及种类：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>文字类：</span></strong><span>Chat GPT, Notion, New Bing</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>图片类：</span></strong><span>Stable Diffusion ( 可 + ControlNet, LoRA ), Mid - Journey，Civitai</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>视频/音频类/数字人: </span></strong><span>D - ID, meta human (UE)，Voice Marker, Whisper</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>AI 收集网站：</span></strong><a href="https://theresanaiforthat.com/" data-url="https://theresanaiforthat.com/"><span>theresanaiforthat.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frrnz7uQ2W-ASuZZTgOdoQ7b3Skt.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Bing生成的大纲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkmF6lhOKTnBM5Ad4goMvZnmORG7.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>问同行可还行？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFx6pmkEdCiAi9JIqb6jgRevEtq.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>离谱的借钱理由</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpcDYOYIqffGYJrlakzOuH2g95Eq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVbjCKOD8rU2Z0NTsaf9bliCEiZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>奥斯卡在即，用AI生成的两部我个人喜欢、看好电影的海报，大家能猜出来吗？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyKx3wSt9YVHusuk9vH6sPEKTTr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>头像，真是一点也不像 ……</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-BoB0E2s12tAWROTrmQ1MYD1ZQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>魔法小房子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqNYeBR7Vv0oU1dzRH_lUsVuVw7W.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>喂的自己的动森岛建生成的多边形小岛美术风格</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾（约 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> ）还有1个小彩蛋哦~&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>各位更喜欢AI设计的本节目封面还是主播设计的呢，欢迎大家投票~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm27th0asejsDcAiCuc6ZADqR01v.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>AI设计</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibPrlnsTAZ5OsCbw1H5coTOQyKb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>主播设计</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期封面生成：Mid - Journey</span></strong></p>]]></description>
