  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 从泉州到黎巴嫩：双塔双城记（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e242bd0d7e8eaa721d9abb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e242bd0d7e8eaa721d9abb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目分为上下集，是对我春节期间在泉州旅行的回顾，以及对于5年前在黎巴嫩旅行的对比于联想，泉州与黎巴嫩在我看来都是因为地理、历史形成的港口城市，都有着悠久历史与多民族、宗教、文化融合的特点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我知道黎巴嫩是一个国家，标题主要是对比了在泉州和在黎巴嫩的首都及第三大城市Saida（双城）的回顾，也算双城吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是上集，泉州旅行回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMIqpJ4lCsGw12qqLbrj_YMwwZX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>泉州标志 - 开元寺双塔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6X_wFWdMFoJufYpLO-5iBLNsBQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>从通淮关岳庙向外看上香的人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkerlTrJhDkjBnmQffjGNr7cF5v2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>天后宫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJF1xi6ahUxpOZven2hFP1B3Lzf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>元妙观</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniGJ4lcDmQmu5M5X9VE69dCEaLr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>白耇古庙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FskplQJRYVIjjvtXyTg2_zNjnl8u.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>春节期间中山路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我去的道观庙宇等：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>佛教</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开元寺</span></p><span></span><p><span>承天寺</span></p><span></span><p><span>铜佛寺</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>基督教 &amp; 天主教</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>泉西堂、泉南堂（百花巷天主堂）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>道教</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>元妙观</span></p><span></span><p><span>妙华古地</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>摩尼教</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>草庵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>印度教</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>白耇古庙</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>伊斯兰教</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>圣墓</span></p><span></span><p><span>清净寺</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>民间信仰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>天后宫</span></p><span></span><p><span>关帝庙</span></p><span></span><p><span>文庙（儒教）</span></p><span></span><p><span>三王祠</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>博物馆 &amp; 其他</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>海外交通史博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>华侨博物馆，闽台缘博物馆等等</span></p><span></span><p><span>东街、西街、钟楼，中山街</span></p><span></span><p><span>市舶司遗址</span></p><span></span><p><span>洛阳桥</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>感兴趣的朋友欢迎收听下集~</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED: 闽南语歌谣 | </span><strong><span>新年歌</span></strong></p>]]></description>
