    <title>Vol.09 新春观影指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ca2f19531dadd2b16803e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ca2f19531dadd2b16803e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Jan 2023 06:05:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春节将至，相信多数听众已经踏上回家的路，甚至已经到家了，其他朋友也多数有了与朋友们庆祝新年的计划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这次针对长假，结合春节的场景和主题，推出一期特别节目：新春观影指南。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一份很私人的片单，主要是从我个人看过的、符合春节场景与主题的一些电影，春节档院线上映的期待的电影，还有一些我一直想看没时间，打算拿春节补看的片单。如果你也对这些电影有兴趣，或者看过其中的一些作品，或者其他有什么推荐春节期间观看的，也欢迎留言与我讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也希望我推荐的电影可以让你不管是自己欢乐补片，与朋友欢聚观看还是转移与亲戚尬聊时的注意力，救我们社恐于水火之中，都可以让你在春节收货平和、喜气与快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝愿我们所有的听众兔年吉祥，平安健康，升职发财，阖家幸福！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片单：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>看过的推荐片单 &nbsp;—— &nbsp;贺岁片版块：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304022/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304022/"><span>《大腕》&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1303173/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1303173/"><span>《甲方乙方》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1296436/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1296436/"><span>《有话好好说》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35765172/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35765172/"><span>《一场很(没)有必要的春晚》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25894885/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25894885/"><span>《舌尖上的新年》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>看过的推荐片单 &nbsp;—— &nbsp;家族主题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291818/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291818/"><span>《饮食男女》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292434/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292434/"><span>《一一》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30314848/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30314848/"><span>《瞬息全宇宙》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30390144/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30390144/"><span>《别告诉她》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1300678/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1300678/"><span>《没事偷着乐》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25867546/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25867546/"><span>《岳父岳母真难当》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>看过的推荐片单 &nbsp;—— &nbsp;爱情与其他：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1305164/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1305164/"><span>《甜蜜蜜》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1301912/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1301912/"><span>《秋天的童话》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304560/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304560/"><span>《二子开店》</span></a><br><span></span><br><span></span><strong><span>其他想看的补片清单：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35158182/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35158182/"><span>《我家的春节》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35068230/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35068230/"><span>《吉祥如意》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/24695390/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/24695390/"><span>《我们假期做了什么》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/27191492/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/27191492/"><span>《四个春天》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30419744/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30419744/"><span>《春江水暖》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/2272222/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/2272222/"><span>《耳朵大有福》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1307812/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1307812/"><span>《双旗镇刀客》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1293391/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1293391/"><span>《孩子王》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26935296/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26935296/"><span>《花椒之味》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25868125/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25868125/"><span>《穿靴子的猫 2》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1293846/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1293846/"><span>《西力传》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26374197/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26374197/"><span>《蜘蛛侠 - 平行宇宙》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>再次祝愿我们的听众兔年吉祥，平安健康，升职发财，阖家幸福！</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED: 中国娃娃 | </span><strong><span>发财发福中国年</span></strong></p>]]></description>
